{"seq":1,"slug":"webview-performance-model-metrics","title":"WebView 性能模型与首屏、内存度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-webview-native-bridge-hybrid-engineering/performance-offline-lifecycle-ops/webview-performance-model-metrics","wordCount":2485,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"webview-性能模型与首屏-内存度量体系\">WebView 性能模型与首屏、内存度量体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-webview-的性能为何不能被压成-一条加载耗时\">核心概念：WebView 的性能为何不能被压成「一条加载耗时」</h2><p>跨境电商容器的性能回归几乎从不表现为「页面打不开」，而是「同一个商品详情页在低端安卓上白屏 1.8 秒、在 iPhone 上 0.6 秒」。要解释这个差异，必须先承认一个事实：<strong>WebView 的时间轴和内存账本都不归宿主应用所有</strong>。时间轴由渲染进程的导航生命周期决定（见 <a href=\"../hybrid-container-architecture-model/webview-loading-navigation-lifecycle\"><code>webview-loading-navigation-lifecycle</code></a>），内存账本由操作系统的进程级共享页统计决定。宿主只能观测，不能直接改写。</p>\n<p>度量体系因此有三条硬约束。其一，<strong>指标必须绑定到「谁负责」</strong>：<code>load</code> 向子资源负责、<code>onPageCommitVisible</code> 向合成器负责、<code>DOMContentLoaded</code> 向 DOM 解析负责，混成一个「加载耗时」会让优化方向失控。其二，<strong>WebView 不上报 CrUX</strong>——Chrome 的 Core Web Vitals 真实用户数据只覆盖浏览器渠道，不覆盖嵌在 App 里的 WebView（来源：Google Chrome User Experience Report），所以容器必须自建埋点。其三，<strong>首屏与内存是两条独立轴</strong>，离线包体膨胀会同时抬高两者，但网络抖动只抬高首屏。</p>\n<p>下面这张图给出一次导航中，可观测信号从渲染进程到宿主指标仓库的完整流向：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[loadRequest / loadUrl] --&gt; B[原生导航回调&lt;br/&gt;didStartProvisionalNavigation / onPageStarted]&#10;  B --&gt; C[渲染进程导航]&#10;  C --&gt; D[PerformanceObserver&lt;br/&gt;paint / navigation / LCP / event 条目]&#10;  C --&gt; E[原生首帧信号&lt;br/&gt;postVisualStateCallback / didCommit]&#10;  D --&gt; F[JS 侧 T1 缓冲&lt;br/&gt;visibilitychange 时 flush]&#10;  E --&gt; G[宿主侧 T2 时间戳]&#10;  F --&gt; H[统一指标仓库]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  A --&gt; I[内存采样]&#10;  I --&gt; J[Android: dumpsys meminfo&lt;br/&gt;PSS/USS 按进程]&#10;  I --&gt; K[iOS: MetricKit MXMemoryMetric&lt;br/&gt;+ task_info phys_footprint]&#10;  J --&gt; H&#10;  K --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; L[分位聚合 P50/P75/P95]&#10;  L --&gt; M{对比基线阈值}&#10;  M --&gt;|超阈| N[回归告警 + 设备/版本切片]&#10;  M --&gt;|正常| O[归档]\">flowchart TD\n  A[loadRequest / loadUrl] --&gt; B[原生导航回调&lt;br/&gt;didStartProvisionalNavigation / onPageStarted]\n  B --&gt; C[渲染进程导航]\n  C --&gt; D[PerformanceObserver&lt;br/&gt;paint / navigation / LCP / event 条目]\n  C --&gt; E[原生首帧信号&lt;br/&gt;postVisualStateCallback / didCommit]\n  D --&gt; F[JS 侧 T1 缓冲&lt;br/&gt;visibilitychange 时 flush]\n  E --&gt; G[宿主侧 T2 时间戳]\n  F --&gt; H[统一指标仓库]\n  G --&gt; H\n  A --&gt; I[内存采样]\n  I --&gt; J[Android: dumpsys meminfo&lt;br/&gt;PSS/USS 按进程]\n  I --&gt; K[iOS: MetricKit MXMemoryMetric&lt;br/&gt;+ task_info phys_footprint]\n  J --&gt; H\n  K --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; L[分位聚合 P50/P75/P95]\n  L --&gt; M{对比基线阈值}\n  M --&gt;|超阈| N[回归告警 + 设备/版本切片]\n  M --&gt;|正常| O[归档]</pre><p>关键设计是 <strong>H 这个汇聚点</strong>：JS 侧时间戳（<code>performance.now()</code> 时钟域）和原生侧时间戳（<code>mach_absolute_time</code> / <code>SystemClock.elapsedRealtime</code> 时钟域）不能直接相减，必须先做一次时钟对齐，否则首屏时间会凭空多出几百毫秒。惯用做法是在导航决策时刻把原生时钟值经 <code>evaluateJavaScript</code> 注入页面，作为两条时间轴的共同原点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"首屏度量-从导航发起到首帧可交互\">首屏度量：从导航发起到首帧可交互</h2><p>「首屏」在混合容器里至少要拆成四个可独立回归的观测量，它们各自对应不同的优化手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测量</th>\n<th>采集源</th>\n<th>平台覆盖</th>\n<th>对应的优化动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FCP（首次内容绘制）</td>\n<td>W3C Paint Timing API，<code>PerformancePaintTiming</code></td>\n<td>Android WebView 与 iOS WKWebView 均可（Blink/WebKit 实现）</td>\n<td>关键 CSS 内联、字体 <code>font-display:swap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCP（最大内容绘制）</td>\n<td>W3C Largest Contentful Paint</td>\n<td>两平台 JS 侧可采</td>\n<td>首屏图懒加载策略、图片格式（AVIF/WebP）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生首帧</td>\n<td>Android <code>WebViewCompat.postVisualStateCallback</code>；iOS <code>didCommit</code></td>\n<td>Android 最可靠，iOS 无完全对等信号</td>\n<td>渲染进程预热、<code>setRendererPriorityPolicy</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTI / INP</td>\n<td>W3C Event Timing API（<code>event</code> 条目）</td>\n<td>两平台 JS 侧可采；INP 已取代 FID（来源：web.dev Web Vitals）</td>\n<td>hydration 分片、长任务切分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个只对真机暴露的陷阱：<strong>FCP 和原生首帧常常不同步</strong>。渲染进程可能已合成一帧纯背景色而 FCP 尚未触发，也可能 FCP 已触发但合成器还没把帧提交到屏幕。若告警只看 FCP，会漏掉「页面已解析但用户看到白屏」这类事故。Android 侧应以 <code>postVisualStateCallback</code> 为首屏可交互主信号、FCP 为辅助；iOS 侧因缺少公开原生首帧回调，通常退用 <code>didCommit</code> 加一次 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 往返来近似。</p>\n<p>Google 对 Core Web Vitals 给出的「良好」阈值可作容器基线的一级参考，但它们是<strong>浏览器全站</strong>口径，容器内因设备更集中、网络更多样，阈值通常需重新标定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TTI</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>75</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>s</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>INP</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>75</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>CLS</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>75</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TTI}_{p75} \\le 2.5\\,\\text{s},\\quad \\text{INP}_{p75} \\le 200\\,\\text{ms},\\quad \\text{CLS}_{p75} \\le 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTI</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">INP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（阈值来源：web.dev「Web Vitals」；TTFB 良好线为 800 ms。）</p>\n<p>实践中更稳的做法是<strong>先在自己 App 的 P75 上建立冻结基线</strong>，再把「超过基线 20%」作为回归门，而非直接套用上表。跨境电商尤其如此：同一份页面在东南亚低端机上，网络往返（RTT）可能比北美高一个数量级，套用北美阈值会产生大量假告警。</p>\n<p>页面级采集的骨架代码是同一套 API，两个平台通用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const obs = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const e of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    if (e.entryType === &#39;paint&#39;) report(&#39;paint&#39;, e.name, e.startTime);&#10;    if (e.entryType === &#39;largest-contentful-paint&#39;) report(&#39;lcp&#39;, e.startTime);&#10;    if (e.entryType === &#39;event&#39; &amp;&amp; e.duration &gt; 100) report(&#39;long-event&#39;, e.name, e.duration);&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;obs.observe({ type: &#39;paint&#39;, buffered: true });&#10;obs.observe({ type: &#39;largest-contentful-paint&#39;, buffered: true });&#10;obs.observe({ type: &#39;event&#39;, buffered: true, durationThreshold: 100 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const obs = new PerformanceObserver((list) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const e of list.getEntries()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (e.entryType === 'paint') report('paint', e.name, e.startTime);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (e.entryType === 'largest-contentful-paint') report('lcp', e.startTime);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (e.entryType === 'event' &#x26;&#x26; e.duration > 100) report('long-event', e.name, e.duration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obs.observe({ type: 'paint', buffered: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obs.observe({ type: 'largest-contentful-paint', buffered: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obs.observe({ type: 'event', buffered: true, durationThreshold: 100 });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>buffered: true</code> 不能省——埋点脚本常在页面已绘制后才注入，没有缓冲会丢掉最早的 paint 条目。上报时机应挂在 <code>visibilitychange</code> 转入 <code>hidden</code> 时（配合 <code>navigator.sendBeacon</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存度量-pss-footprint-与渲染进程的真实归属\">内存度量：PSS、footprint 与渲染进程的真实归属</h2><p>内存侧的分歧比时间轴更大，因为两套操作系统的记账口径根本不同。</p>\n<p><strong>Android 用 PSS，而非 RSS 或 USS。</strong> 一个页面会加载大量共享页（同一份字体、同一个 <code>libwebviewchromium</code> 代码段被多个进程映射）。RSS 把这些共享页在各进程各算一次，总量虚高；USS 只算私有页，又漏掉真正被 WebView 占用的共享内存。PSS 按共享比例摊分，是唯一可加的口径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PSS</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>USS</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PSS}_i = \\text{USS}_i + \\sum_{j} \\frac{|S_j|}{n_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">USS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8408em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是进程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 映射的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 个共享页组，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是同时映射该页组的进程数。采集命令是 <code>adb shell dumpsys meminfo &lt;package&gt;</code>，其中 <code>TOTAL PSS</code> 行即应用占用；WebView 渲染进程在启用多进程模式后常表现为同一包名下的独立进程项，必须一并统计，否则会低估容器开销。</p>\n<p><strong>iOS 用 phys_footprint（脏内存），并区分 WebContent 进程。</strong> WKWebView 自 iOS 8 起把网页内容跑在独立 WebContent 进程、网络栈跑在 Networking 进程。因此只盯主 App 进程会系统性低估 WebView 的内存成本——被 jetsam 杀掉时往往是 WebContent 进程先死，表现为页面突然白屏而非 App 崩溃。运行时可用 <code>task_info</code> 取 <code>phys_footprint</code>，并用 <code>os_proc_available_memory()</code>（iOS 13+）查询进程可用内存上限以判定离 jetsam 还有多远。生产环境推荐接 MetricKit 的 <code>MXMemoryMetric</code>（峰值内存）与 <code>MXHangDiagnostic</code>，由系统按天聚合回传，覆盖真实用户设备。</p>\n<p>两个平台都有「离死亡还有多远」的信号，容器应主动订阅并降级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Android：<code>onTrimMemory(level)</code>，<code>TRIM_MEMORY_RUNNING_LOW</code> / <code>TRIM_MEMORY_COMPLETE</code> 是需立刻释放缓存 WebView 实例的档位；<code>WebViewRenderProcessClient.onRenderProcessGone</code> / <code>onRenderProcessUnresponsive</code> 处理渲染进程被回收或卡死。</li>\n<li>iOS：<code>UIApplication.didReceiveMemoryWarningNotification</code>，以及内存压力下回收 bfcache 后的 <code>pagehide</code>（<code>persisted=true</code> 无法保持）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>度量内存时必须把<strong>实例数与页面栈深度</strong>一起记录，否则无法解释回归。一个常见现象是：单页内存没变，但因导航栈无上限地堆积 WebView 实例，整体 PSS 线性上涨。这条规则与容器拓扑直接相关，可对照 <a href=\"../hybrid-container-architecture-model/hybrid-container-topology-model\"><code>hybrid-container-topology-model</code></a> 的实例归属讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微监测-把-js-侧指标和原生-trace-拼成一条时间轴\">微监测：把 JS 侧指标和原生 trace 拼成一条时间轴</h2><p>只有平台级指标还不够。跨境电商容器要回答「这次首屏慢，是网络还是 JS 还是渲染」，需要三条 trace 的拼接：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>网络</strong>：W3C Resource Timing 给出每个子资源的 <code>domainLookupStart</code> → <code>responseEnd</code>，能区分 DNS、TCP/TLS 握手、TTFB 与下载。容器拦截的请求（如走原生代理的离线包请求）在 Resource Timing 里可能缺项，需原生侧补一条。</li>\n<li><strong>JS / 主线程</strong>：Long Tasks API 与 Event Timing 一起用，定位 hydration 阻塞；Android 可叠加 Perfetto/systrace 看帧提交。</li>\n<li><strong>渲染</strong>：Android 的 <code>FrameMetrics</code>（<code>Window.addOnFrameMetricsAvailableListener</code>）或 Perfetto 的 <code>Choreographer</code> 帧；iOS 用 Xcode 的 Animation Hitches 模板与 <code>CADisplayLink</code> 采样。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原生集成测试则用 XCTest 的性能 API 把首屏和内存纳入 CI：<code>XCTOSSignpostMetric</code> 度量自定义区间（从 <code>loadRequest</code> 到首帧回调），<code>XCTMemoryMetric</code> 与 <code>XCTClockMetric</code> 分别度量内存与耗时。其价值在于<strong>可重复</strong>——真机 Lab 下的相对回归比绝对值更可信。</p>\n<p>拼接时有一个易忽略的坑：<strong>首屏指标必须与「导航类型」绑定</strong>。冷启动首次加载、离线包命中、bfcache 恢复、<code>pushState</code> 的 SPA 内跳转，四者耗时才有可比性。混进同一分位桶会让 P95 完全失去意义。这与能力路由层的流量形态相关，可参考 <a href=\"../native-capability-routing-security/capability-router-registry-model\"><code>capability-router-registry-model</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基线-阈值与回归判定\">基线、阈值与回归判定</h2><p>有了指标不等于有治理。可执行的基线需要三个属性：<strong>冻结</strong>（发布前锁定数值，避免「移动靶」）、<strong>可切片</strong>（按设备档位、系统版本、WebView 版本、离线包版本分组）、<strong>有归因方向</strong>（超阈时能立刻指到网络 / JS / 渲染 / 内存四类之一）。判定规则建议写成显式不等式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>首屏：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>FCP</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>75</mn></mrow><mtext>dev</mtext></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>Base</mtext><mtext>dev</mtext></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FCP}_{p75}^{\\text{dev}} &gt; \\text{Base}^{\\text{dev}} \\times 1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3054em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FCP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0057em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dev</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span> 触发回归（<code>dev</code> 为设备档位分组）。</li>\n<li>内存：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>PSS</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><mtext>页面</mtext></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>300</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PSS}_{p95}^{\\text{页面}} &gt; 300\\,\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2977em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9146em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">页面</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span> 或相对上一版本增长超 15% 时告警；阈值按目标机型内存等级重标（2 GB RAM 低端机与 12 GB RAM 旗舰机不可共用绝对阈值）。</li>\n<li>卡顿：Android 关注 ANR 率与卡顿率（Android Vitals）；iOS 关注 hang rate（MetricKit <code>MXHangDiagnostic</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分位选择本身是设计决策：平均值掩盖长尾，P95 又易被单台异常设备污染。容器场景推荐 <strong>P75 作常规门、P95 作告警门</strong>，并对样本量做下限保护（单组样本低于 50 不参与判定）。</p>\n<p>最后一条纪律：<strong>基线只对同口径比较</strong>。WebView 是经应用商店独立更新的组件，一次大版本升级就可能在业务代码零改动下改变 FCP 分布；回归判定必须把 WebView 版本作为切片维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WebView 的时间轴与内存账本分别归渲染进程和操作系统所有，宿主只能观测；第一原则是<strong>每个指标绑定到「谁负责」</strong>。</li>\n<li>首屏拆成 FCP / LCP / 原生首帧 / TTI-INP 四个可独立回归的量；Android 以 <code>postVisualStateCallback</code> 为主信号，iOS 用 <code>didCommit</code> 加帧往返近似。</li>\n<li>内存口径按平台固定：<strong>Android 用 PSS 按共享比例摊分、必算渲染进程；iOS 用 phys_footprint 并区分 WebContent 进程</strong>，生产接 MetricKit 覆盖真实设备。</li>\n<li>Core Web Vitals 公开阈值（LCP 2.5 s / INP 200 ms / CLS 0.1）只作一级参考，容器内应在自身 P75 上冻结基线，用「超基线 20%」判回归。</li>\n<li>微监测靠 JS 侧 PerformanceObserver 与原生 trace 拼接；拼接前须做时钟对齐，首屏指标须与导航类型绑定，四种导航不可混桶。</li>\n<li>判定规则写成显式不等式，分位取 P75 常规门 / P95 告警门，并把 WebView 版本作为独立切片维度——它是唯一能在业务零改动下改变分布的外部变量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WebView 性能模型与首屏、内存度量体系","id":"webview-性能模型与首屏-内存度量体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：WebView 的性能为何不能被压成「一条加载耗时」","id":"核心概念-webview-的性能为何不能被压成-一条加载耗时"},{"level":2,"text":"首屏度量：从导航发起到首帧可交互","id":"首屏度量-从导航发起到首帧可交互"},{"level":2,"text":"内存度量：PSS、footprint 与渲染进程的真实归属","id":"内存度量-pss-footprint-与渲染进程的真实归属"},{"level":2,"text":"微监测：把 JS 侧指标和原生 trace 拼成一条时间轴","id":"微监测-把-js-侧指标和原生-trace-拼成一条时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"基线、阈值与回归判定","id":"基线-阈值与回归判定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WebView 安全加固、桥接漏洞与合规审查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-webview-native-bridge-hybrid-engineering/native-capability-routing-security/webview-security-hardening-compliance"},"next":{"title":"离线包分发、预加载与增量更新机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-webview-native-bridge-hybrid-engineering/performance-offline-lifecycle-ops/offline-package-preload-mechanism"}}